# BACKUP & TEMPORARY FILES
#================================================

# Backup files
*.bak
*.backup
*.old
*.orig
*.tmp

# Temporary files
tmp/
temp/
*.temp

# Archives (if accidentally created)
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.rar
*.7z

